'''using gitignore I can stop some uneccessary 
files or large datasets from uploaded in github'''

#dataset

data/

'''removes the dataset from being uploaded'''


#python cache

__pycache__?
*.py[cod]

'''remove temperorily compiled python files'''


#virtual environment

.venv/
venv/


'''it contains python interpreter environment and installed packages 
but it is enough to add the requirement file'''


#Jupiter temporary files

.ipynp_checkpoints/

'''it contains the temperorily created jupiter checkpoit files'''

#IDE setting

.vscode/

'''it contains workspace setting specific to my vscode'''

# Environment variables and secrets
.env

'''Ignores the files that contain API keya,pass words, and other credenitals'''

